    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83466.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "Well, one comment you made in the book, the central solution was that during your 24 years in the US Senate, times became much more partisan and life in the Senate became more partisan. Do you have any feel Senator for what's caused this partisanship?",
